2026-08-07T03:00:49.3503479Z > # CRAN guard
2026-08-07T03:00:49.3503629Z > #
2026-08-07T03:00:49.3503939Z > # The duckdb test suite exercises DuckDB's bundled C++ engine, which is too heavy
2026-08-07T03:00:49.3504398Z > # for CRAN's check farm, and checks were very fragile in the past. We therefore
2026-08-07T03:00:49.3504852Z > # keep it off on CRAN but run it automatically on GitHub Actions (GITHUB_ACTIONS)
2026-08-07T03:00:49.3505286Z > # and on r-universe (MY_UNIVERSE). An explicit DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS opts in
2026-08-07T03:00:49.3505721Z > # (true-ish) or out (false-ish) and always wins; otherwise we fall back to those.
2026-08-07T03:00:49.3506181Z > # This check is intentionally inlined here (rather than calling into the package)
2026-08-07T03:00:49.3506549Z > # so the guard is obvious and self-contained.
